  "bodyHash": "s6531pOW8oU=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">終界傳送門配方是一個模組，讓終界傳送門可合成、可移動，並可在生存模式中使用，同時還有其他調整。由於配方需要龍蛋，玩家只有在<strong>擊敗終界龍之後</strong>才能使用新的傳送門。不過，可以從要塞中拿起傳送門框架方塊並移動到其他地方。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveSilkTouchToBreakPortal</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家必須在鎬上附有絲綢之觸才能破壞傳送門框架。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>addBrokenPortalFramesToInventory</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，將傳送門框架直接加入玩家的物品欄，以降低其被摧毀的機率。若物品欄已滿，仍會掉落物品實體。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnExtraDragonEggDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否要發送訊息給玩家，告知額外龍蛋將會掉落的位置。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>功能</strong></strong></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">終界龍</span></strong>現在必定會掉落龍蛋。如果是第一次擊殺，一個會在基座上，另一個則在玩家的物品欄中。</strong><br><br></p><p><strong>終界傳送門現在可以合成，配方如下：</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<em> 5 個終界之眼、1 個龍蛋、3 個終界石</em><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/a.jpg\" alt=\"1\" width=\"462\" height=\"207\"><br><br><strong>你可以將傳送門放置在任何位置：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/b.jpg\" alt=\"2\" width=\"1138\" height=\"662\"></strong><br><br><strong>將傳送門框架填入終界之眼：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/c.jpg\" alt=\"3\" width=\"1060\" height=\"616\"></strong><br><br><strong>它將會變成終界傳送門：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>請確保以正確的方向放置傳送門</em></span><strong>。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/e.jpg\" alt=\"5\" width=\"1208\" height=\"702\"></strong><br><br><strong>在生存模式中，你可以用任何鎬子破壞終界傳送門。這會掉落框架，以及如果已插入的終界之眼：</strong><br><em>這也會破壞終界傳送門方塊。</em><br><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/f.jpg\" alt=\"6\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>新的設定選項：僅能用絲綢之觸破壞框架，並直接將其傳入玩家的物品欄：</strong></strong><br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/end-portal-recipe/g.webp\" alt=\"新設定\" width=\"1000\" height=\"504\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已停用，因為我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
